program	errors/place_window_through_a_forced_lend_charges_its_root.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	differs
expect	error
build	refused	exclusive access violation: the place `b.opt(…)` borrows `b` for the whole window, and `b` is accessed by reference a second time in the same call
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: exclusive access violation: the place `b.opt(…)` borrows `b` for the whole window, and `b` is accessed by reference a second time in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/errors/place_window_through_a_forced_lend_charges_its_root.saw:35:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 35 |     setboth(&var b.opt(0)!, &var b.opt(1)!)"
log	"     |             ^"
log	"   hint: a place borrow charges its ROOT, so two windows onto one receiver — or a window beside a `&var` of it — cannot both be open. Open them in SEPARATE statements, or reach for the method that does both at once (`v.swap(i, j)`)"
log	""
log	"error: exclusive access violation: the place `b.opt(…)` borrows `b` for the whole window, and `b` is accessed by reference a second time in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/errors/place_window_through_a_forced_lend_charges_its_root.saw:36:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 36 |     setroot(&var b.opt(0)!, &var b)"
log	"     |             ^"
log	"   hint: a place borrow charges its ROOT, so two windows onto one receiver — or a window beside a `&var` of it — cannot both be open. Open them in SEPARATE statements, or reach for the method that does both at once (`v.swap(i, j)`)"
log	""
